  "body": "Stacked on #2077 (merge #2077 first)\n\nFork synced at v0.21.0.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added ASCII DXF annotation (`TEXT`/`MTEXT`) reading and an original ASCII DXF writer in `crates/geometry/src/dxf/`.\n- Added DXF profile parsing, validation, solid meshing, and mesh-silhouette derivation in `crates/geometry/src/dxf_profile.rs`, `profile_mesh.rs`, and `profile_derive.rs`.\n- Supported revolved spun half-profiles (`CENTRELINE`/`AXIS` around `+Z`, convertible with `#743` `SpunProfile`) and extruded closed 2D contours along `X`/`Y`/`Z` with positive depth.\n- Preserved raw STEP bytes in ECS `StepSource`, `.camproj` (`EntityDto.step_source`), and `.camfixtures` (`FixtureEntry.step_source`), never converting imported STEP fixtures into profiles on import.\n- Added undoable commands `InsertProfileFixture`, `SetFixtureProfile`, and `DeriveFixtureProfile`, plus five MCP tools in `crates/app/src/mcp/fixture_profile_tools.rs`.\n- `DeriveFixtureProfile` and `derive_fixture_profile` derive a reference profile only from a STEP fixture. They refuse, by name, a DXF/profile fixture and an imported mesh fixture without a STEP source. Thus the profile that defines the steel stays the collision bound.\n- Added the `\"Add DXF / profile…\"` dialog and per-row edit/derive/DXF-export controls in `crates/ui`, keeping `crates/ui/src/egui_app/fixture_menu.rs` untouched.\n- Added decision record `docs/decisions/744-fixture-profiles.md`.\n\n## Cause\n\nTurning chucks, jaws, collets, vises, parallels, and step blocks lacked parametric 2D profile authoring, DXF import/export, and post-placement profile editing. Vendor STEP fixtures needed to keep their raw STEP geometry intact rather than being replaced by approximated profiles.\n\n## Tests\n\nPins:\n- `camcraft-geometry --test dxf_profile`: `spun_fixture_imports_from_dxf_centreline_plus_half_profile_and_roundtrips`, `extruded_fixture_reads_closed_profile_and_depth_from_annotation_or_arg`, `dxf_profile_malformed_inputs_give_named_errors_never_panic` (3 passed).\n- `camcraft-app --test fixture_profiles`: `spun_dxf_fixture_imports_meshes_edits_and_roundtrips`, `extruded_vise_jaw_from_dxf_is_hit_by_rapid_until_edited_below_it`, `step_fixture_can_optionally_derive_profile_while_keeping_step_as_source`, `profile_fixture_roundtrips_library_and_malformed_project_key_loads_safely` (4 passed).\n- `camcraft-app --test fixture_step_library`: `step_fixture_saves_to_library_as_step_and_reinserts_unchanged` (1 passed).\n- `camcraft-app --test mcp_fixture_profile`: `mcp_fixture_profile_workflow_imports_edits_exports_and_keeps_step`, `mcp_derive_fixture_profile_refuses_generated_fixture_and_keeps_its_profile` (2 passed).\n- `camcraft-app --test fixture_profile_collision`: `generated_fixture_refuses_reference_derivation_and_keeps_its_collision_bound`, `mesh_fixture_without_step_source_refuses_reference_derivation`, plus the 4 earlier collision tests (6 passed).\n- `camcraft-ui --lib egui_app::fixture_profile_tests`: `fixtures_page_button_opens_profile_dialog_and_inserts_dxf_fixtures`, `refused_profile_or_bad_dxf_is_named_in_dialog`, `editing_placed_profile_row_regenerates_mesh_and_exports_dxf`, `step_fixture_keeps_raw_step_and_allows_reference_derive_only` (4 passed inside 852 lib tests).\n\nMutation checks:\n- Weakened `dxf_profile::resolve_depth` positive-depth guard (`> 0.0`): `dxf_profile_malformed_inputs_give_named_errors_never_panic` failed red, restored and passed green.\n- Disabled `SetFixtureProfile::new` STEP-source guard in `profile_fixture.rs`: `mcp_fixture_profile_workflow_imports_edits_exports_and_keeps_step` failed red, restored and passed green.\n- Cleared `ImportModel::apply` `step_source::set` write in `import_model.rs`: `step_fixture_saves_to_library_as_step_and_reinserts_unchanged` failed red, restored and passed green.\n- Disabled the STEP-source guard in `target_fixture` (`profile_fixture.rs`): both new `fixture_profile_collision` tests and `mcp_derive_fixture_profile_refuses_generated_fixture_and_keeps_its_profile` failed red, restored and passed green.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nnone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- `camcraft-app --test docs_troubleshooting::troubleshooting_messages_still_exist_in_the_sources` failed because `base-2077` predates `upstream/main` commit `92430ff0` (`#2051`); our branch made no change to troubleshooting strings and passes once merged with `main`.\n- `gate quick` steps `geometry`, `kernel`, `cl`, `tools`, `post`, `sim`, and `motion` passed prior to server restart (`quick-20261116-012138`); `ui`, workspace `clippy -D warnings`, and all other `app` suites passed in `quick-20261116-015550`.\n- Native OS modal file-picker interaction and wasm32 browser target were not executed in headless mode (tested via `load_profile_dxf_bytes`, `CommandKind::ExportFixtureDxf`, and `browser_files` guards).\n\n## Overlaps\n\n- `#2077` (base of this stack): touches `schema.rs`, `commands/delete_entity.rs`, `commands/mod.rs`, `lib.rs`, `mcp/tools.rs`, `project/{apply,entity,wire}.rs`, `egui_app/mod.rs`, and `state.rs` in different fields/variants; merge `#2077` first.\n- `#2092`: touches `schema.rs`, `mcp/tools.rs`, and `project/{apply,validate,wire}.rs` in different fields and functions; whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#2024`: touches `commands/update_model.rs` and `project/{apply,entity,validate}.rs` in different fields (`mesh_open` vs `step_source`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n- `#1687`: left `crates/ui/src/egui_app/fixture_menu.rs` untouched to avoid conflicting.\n\nChangelog: add spun and extruded fixture profiles with DXF import/export and raw STEP preservation\n\n\n## UI screenshots\n\nThese images render the actual egui controls through the UI test harness.\nThe before images use the presentation files `fixtures_page.rs` and `fixture_rows.rs` from parent commit `75031d5f9b5e6f9d2f297108ff51e3c0d0c5c3fb` (#2077).\nThe fixture state is the same in each pair. The after images use this PR with the review fixes.\nThese are control views. The images do not show the native file picker or the 3D viewport.\n\n| Controls | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| Fixtures page entry | ![Before: Fixtures page entry](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/fixture-page-before.png) | ![After: Fixtures page entry](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/fixture-page-after.png) |\n| Placed profile editor | ![Before: Placed profile editor](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/profile-editor-before.png) | ![After: Placed profile editor](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/profile-editor-after.png) |\n| STEP source and derivation | ![Before: STEP source and derivation](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/step-derive-before.png) | ![After: STEP source and derivation](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/step-derive-after.png) |\n\nThe new profile dialog shows DXF import, profile points, depth, and placement.\n\n![New profile dialog](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926/2101/profile-dialog-after.png)\n\nImages are stored only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch at `22e999baaef24e42596ebe8bc3b7a6dbbebcb926`.\n\nFixes #744\n",
